> <p>2<sup>x</sup>=24  X  2/3=8 X 2=16</p> <p>2<sup>x</sup>=16 &#8594; 2<sup>x</sup>=2<sup>4</sup> &#8594;x=4</p> <p>Therefore 4<sup>4</sup> = 256</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>2<sup>x</sup>+2<sup>x-1</sup>=24</p> <p>2<sup>x</sup>+ 2<sup>x</sup>/2=24 &#8594; 2<sup>x</sup> (1+1/2)=24</p> <p>2<sup>x</sup>=24  X  2/3=8 X 2=16</p> <p>2<sup>x</sup>=16 &#8594; 2<sup>x</sup>=2<sup>4</sup> &#8594;x=4</p> <p>Therefore 4<sup>4</sup> = 256</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If (3<sup>x</sup>)(3<sup>y</sup>) = 27 and (16)<sup>x</sup> (4<sup>y</sup>) = 256 then find the value of x and y?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (3<sup>x</sup>)(3<sup>y</sup>) = 27 &#2324;&#2352; (16)<sup>x</sup> (4<sup>y</sup>) = 256 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; x &#2324;&#2352; y &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;?</p>", "options_en": ["x = 1, y = 2", "x = 1, y = 3", "x = 3, y = 1", "x = 2, y = 1"], "options_hi": ["x = 1, y = 2", "x = 1, y = 3", "x = 3, y = 1", "x = 2, y = 1"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>3<sup>x+y</sup> = 3<sup>3</sup> and 4<sup>2x+y</sup> = 4<sup>4</sup></p><p>So, x+y = 3 and 2x+y = 4. On solving these equations, we get x=1, y=2</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>3<sup>x+y</sup> = 3<sup>3</sup> and 4<sup>2x+y</sup> = 4<sup>4</sup></p><p>So, x+y = 3 and 2x+y = 4. On solving these equations, we get x=1, y=2</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If a = b<sup>3,</sup> b = c<sup>1/3,</sup> c = d<sup>2</sup> and d = e<sup>1/2</sup> then find a x b x c x d x e.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a = b<sup>3,</sup> b = c<sup>1/3,</sup> c = d<sup>2</sup> &#2324;&#2352; d = e<sup>1/2</sup> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; a x b x c x d x e &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["a<sup>22/3</sup>", "a<sup>31/6</sup>", "a<sup>2</sup>", "a<sup>23/6</sup>"], "options_hi": ["a<sup>22/3</sup>", "a<sup>31/6</sup>", "a<sup>2</sup>", "a<sup>23/6</sup>"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>a x b x c x d x e</p><p>= a x 